1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,420
Man: I'm so excited about our road trip this weekend

2
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:09,210
I'm all packed and got the food and snacks for the trip.

3
00:00:09,210 --> 00:00:12,240
Woman: I thought David was supposed to prepare snacks.

4
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:17,020
Man: No, it was me. David signed up to bring water for everyone.

5
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:17,250
Woman: I see.

6
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:19,270
Man: Are you all packed?

7
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:23,360
Woman: Yes, I just want to get my car checked before we leave

8
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:26,090
I'm taking it to the mechanic tomorrow morning.

9
00:00:26,090 --> 00:00:28,036
Man: Good idea. By the way,

10
00:00:28,036 --> 00:00:31,640
I just checked and there might be light showers in the afternoon

11
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:34,200
but overall good weather on our route.
